    "closed": true,
    "closedAt": "2025-01-23T08:49:01Z",
    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nThat's not a 'mini.extra' issue per se, but the fact that you also updated to the latest Nightly. The neovim/neovim#32070 made `vim.lsp.buf.document_symbol` ignore `on_list` if `loclist = false` is not set explicitly. The neovim/neovim#32177 should fix it upstream.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">That's not a 'mini.extra' issue per se, but the fact that you also updated to the latest Nightly. The <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2795408739\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/32070\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/neovim/neovim/pull/32070/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/32070\">neovim/neovim#32070</a> made <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.lsp.buf.document_symbol</code> ignore <code class=\"notranslate\">on_list</code> if <code class=\"notranslate\">loclist = false</code> is not set explicitly. The <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2806284942\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/32177\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/neovim/neovim/pull/32177/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/32177\">neovim/neovim#32177</a> should fix it upstream.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Hi!\nThat's not a 'mini.extra' issue per se, but the fact that you also updated to the latest Nightly. The neovim/neovim#32070 made vim.lsp.buf.document_symbol ignore on_list if loclist = false is not set explicitly. The neovim/neovim#32177 should fix it upstream.",
